cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ScaffoldBench or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: ScaffoldBench
abstract: >-
  An open benchmark of agent harness architectures on the Claude Agent SDK.
  Every architecture gets the same models, tools and tasks, a fidelity gate
  checks that it ran as designed, and every comparison is a paired,
  task-clustered estimate with an interval.
authors:
